1
00:00:01,005 --> 00:00:04,695
4:40. The school just moved Mia's pickup to 5:15.

2
00:00:05,198 --> 00:00:06,771
Alex's train is late.

3
00:00:07,621 --> 00:00:10,136
One change. The whole evening comes apart.

4
00:00:11,941 --> 00:00:15,409
Relay Home rebuilds the evening. And it asks before it acts.

5
00:00:17,814 --> 00:00:18,847
Say what changed.

6
00:00:19,770 --> 00:00:24,065
Who can collect Mia. What dinner fits. One plan.

7
00:00:25,488 --> 00:00:29,394
Every step: a real MCP call.

8
00:00:32,684 --> 00:00:37,841
Not on the school list: never suggested.

9
00:00:40,745 --> 00:00:47,021
Nothing happens without your yes.

10
00:00:48,442 --> 00:00:52,369
Asked. Not covered until Jo answers.

11
00:00:52,530 --> 00:00:56,663
A private link, for this request only.

12
00:00:59,771 --> 00:01:01,465
Jo's phone. One question.

13
00:01:05,404 --> 00:01:09,114
Confirmed, from Jo's own phone.

14
00:01:11,191 --> 00:01:15,553
The exact total. Nothing more.

15
00:01:16,966 --> 00:01:19,050
Once. Inside the weekly cap.

16
00:01:20,475 --> 00:01:22,519
Jo cannot make it.

17
00:01:24,610 --> 00:01:30,359
It stops. It names no one.

18
00:01:31,683 --> 00:01:40,921
A self-hosted MCP server. An Agent Skill. MCP Apps cards.

19
00:01:41,222 --> 00:01:44,453
The same server, from a Strands agent.

20
00:01:47,271 --> 00:01:49,544
Relay Home. It asks before it acts.
